title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/poster_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.

@maintain
subtitle: We gain [+ dues +] resources per year.

We maintain our current dues.

@reduce
subtitle: We gain [+ dues - 1 +] resources per year.
choose-if: dues > 1 and resources >= 1
on-arrival: dues -= 1; resources -= 1; new_left_dissent -= 8; democratic_socialist_dissent -= 8; pragmatist_dissent -= 8; trade_unionist_dissent -= 8

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.
 
@increase
subtitle: We gain [+ dues + 1 +] resources per year. [? if inflation >= 3 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: dues += 1; resources += 1; workers_spd -= 0.8; white_collar_workers_spd -= 0.8; workers_spd -= 1.5 if inflation >= 3; white_collar_workers_spd -= 1.5 if inflation >= 3; workers_spd -= 0.8*dues if dues >= 5; white_collar_workers_spd -= 0.8*dues if dues >= 5;
view-if: dues <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources. 

[? if inflation >= 3 : Because of the presently high inflation, our members are feeling the extra burden hard. ?]

